{"id":"628088","name":"凉拌莴笋","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/628088/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"莴笋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"米椒","amount":"几个"},{"name":"大蒜头","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好莴笋，去皮。","img":"images/628088/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"斜切成薄片。","img":"images/628088/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅烧水，加少许油，水开后下入莴笋片焯水2分钟。","img":"images/628088/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"过凉水。","img":"images/628088/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入大碗中，加入米椒、大蒜头，生抽。","img":"images/628088/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盐(根据自己口味,也可以不加，因为有了生抽，盐差不多合适)鸡精。","img":"images/628088/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"浇上热油，翻拌均匀即可。","img":"images/628088/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"好了，开吃了。","img":"images/628088/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}